# Agent behavior

## Session start

1. Read repo `AGENTS.md`.
2. Read Obsidian [[mini-ramses — debug-playbook]] before any cluster build or submit.
3. Read [[mini-ramses — hub]] and the target [[runbook — Stellar]] or [[runbook — Marlowe]].

Vault root: `/Users/moseley/Documents/Obsidian Vault/20-projects/mini-ramses/`

## Execution limits

- This agent usually **cannot** compile NVHPC/CUDA or run Slurm jobs from Mac.
- Provide exact cluster commands; state assumptions (branch, `MINIRAM`, flags, case name).
- Do not claim a fix worked without fresh `run.log` verification.

## Edits

- Never silently change namelist defaults — show diff.
- Do not commit unless explicitly asked.

## Session end (long tasks)

Summarize for user handoff:

- SHAs / files changed
- Verified vs assumed
- Next exact command (include `./submit_profiles.sh <case>` name)
- Remind about `templates/session-handoff.md` in vault
